# Deliberately opts this subtree OUT of the parent repo's `use flake`
# devShell. The Tauri UI shell is developed against the system's own
# rustup/cargo-tauri/bun toolchain (already working, already has a real
# display via WSLg), not the Nix devShell used for hw-probe/ingest --
# that Nix environment has no GTK/webkit libs and would shadow a working
# toolchain with a broken one. Packaging the built app for the actual
# NixOS-based device is a separate, later concern (see the packaging task).
